@startuml SpringSecurity_Sequence_OAuth2Login
!include https://raw.githubusercontent.com/plantuml-stdlib/C4-PlantUML/master/C4_Sequence.puml

title 序列图 — OAuth2 / OIDC Login（授权码流）

actor "User" as User
participant "Browser" as Browser
participant "OAuth2Authorization\nRequestRedirectFilter" as RedirectFilter
participant "OAuth2 / OIDC IdP" as IdP
participant "OAuth2Login\nAuthenticationFilter" as LoginFilter
participant "OAuth2Login\nAuthenticationProvider" as Provider
participant "Authorization Server\nToken Endpoint" as TokenEp
participant "UserInfo / JWT" as UserInfo
participant "SecurityContext" as Ctx

User -> Browser: 点击「使用 IdP 登录」
Browser -> RedirectFilter: GET /oauth2/authorization/{registrationId}
RedirectFilter --> Browser: 302 → IdP authorize URL\n(state / PKCE / nonce)
Browser -> IdP: Authorization Request
User -> IdP: 登录并同意授权
IdP --> Browser: 302 → redirect_uri?code&state
Browser -> LoginFilter: GET /login/oauth2/code/{registrationId}
LoginFilter -> LoginFilter: 校验 state，构建\nOAuth2LoginAuthenticationToken
LoginFilter -> Provider: authenticate()
Provider -> TokenEp: 交换 authorization_code → tokens
TokenEp --> Provider: access_token [/ id_token]
opt OIDC
    Provider -> Provider: 校验 ID Token (JOSE)
end
opt 需要用户属性
    Provider -> UserInfo: 请求 UserInfo
    UserInfo --> Provider: claims
end
Provider --> LoginFilter: OAuth2AuthenticationToken（已认证）
LoginFilter -> Ctx: 保存 Authentication
LoginFilter --> Browser: 重定向至应用成功 URL

@enduml
